{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794917522581,"sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call-8f07a81d-40c9-411d-89bc-95117aeb3716","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/record/record.py","oldString":"if name == \"check-anchors\":\n            p.add_argument(\"--ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\")\n            p.add_argument(\"--explorer\", action=\"append\", default=None,\n                           help=\"esplora API base; default blockstream.info and mempool.space\")","newString":"if name == \"check-anchors\":\n            p.add_argument(\"--ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\")\n            p.add_argument(\"--explorer\", action=\"append\", default=None,\n                           help=\"esplora API base; default blockstream.info and mempool.space\")\n            p.add_argument(\"--max-pending-hours\", type=int, metavar=\"H\",\n                           help=\"exit 1 if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its sigstore attestation is older than H hours\")"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/record/record.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/record/record.py\n+++ /workspace/record/record.py\n@@ -611,8 +611,10 @@\n if name == \"check-anchors\":\n     p.add_argument(\"--ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--explorer\", action=\"append\", default=None,\n                    help=\"esplora API base; default blockstream.info and mempool.space\")\n+    p.add_argument(\"--max-pending-hours\", type=int, metavar=\"H\",\n+                   help=\"exit 1 if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its sigstore attestation is older than H hours\")\n else:\n     p.add_argument(\"--only-ref\", help=\"check this ref only (default: every ref GitHub names)\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--ledger-ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\", help=\"the ledger's branch; a force push to it is wrong\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--git-rev\", default=\"HEAD\", help=\"the ledger branch's history in this clone (for orphan checks)\")\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/record/record.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/record/record.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/record/record.py\n+++ /workspace/record/record.py\n@@ -611,8 +611,10 @@\n if name == \"check-anchors\":\n     p.add_argument(\"--ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--explorer\", action=\"append\", default=None,\n                    help=\"esplora API base; default blockstream.info and mempool.space\")\n+    p.add_argument(\"--max-pending-hours\", type=int, metavar=\"H\",\n+                   help=\"exit 1 if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its sigstore attestation is older than H hours\")\n else:\n     p.add_argument(\"--only-ref\", help=\"check this ref only (default: every ref GitHub names)\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--ledger-ref\", default=\"refs/heads/main\", help=\"the ledger's branch; a force push to it is wrong\")\n     p.add_argument(\"--git-rev\", default=\"HEAD\", help=\"the ledger branch's history in this clone (for orphan checks)\")\n","additions":2,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"workspace/record/record.py","time":{"start":1794917522563,"end":1794917522572}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"All tests pass. Now I need to implement the `--max-pending-hours` option. Let me understand the flow:\n\n1. In `cmd_check_anchors`, we process anchors (both `.sigstore.json` and `.ots` files)\n2. For `.sigstore.json` files, we get the attestation time `t` (integrated time from Rekor)\n3. For `.ots` files, we check the OpenTimestamps proof - it returns a Bitcoin block time or `None` if pending\n4. The range heads are the `to_seq` values from sigstore attestations, and each range head should have an `.ots` proof\n\nI need to:\n1. Add `--max-pending-hours` argument to the check-anchors subparser\n2. Track the attestation time for each range head (the `to_seq` from sigstore)\n3. When checking an `.ots` proof for a range head, if it's pending (returns `None`) and `--max-pending-hours` is set, check if the attestation time is more than H hours ago\n4. If so, add a \"bad\" entry with the message \"still pending N h\"\n\nLet me implement this.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e96bdc7e001vEvTYCvxZYiNqY","sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","messageID":"msg_1e96bc41f001xpX2Hdq2qoDFZv"}}
