{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794917674208,"sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call-bd5a3933-ae40-4bc9-9571-9bd4716d9c4b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/record && python3 record.py check-anchors --help"},"output":"usage: record.py check-anchors [-h] [--repo REPO] [--workflow WORKFLOW]\n                               [--ref REF] [--explorer EXPLORER]\n                               [--max-pending-hours H]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --repo REPO\n  --workflow WORKFLOW\n  --ref REF\n  --explorer EXPLORER   esplora API base; default blockstream.info and\n                        mempool.space\n  --max-pending-hours H\n                        exit 1 if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its\n                        sigstore attestation is older than H hours\n","metadata":{"output":"usage: record.py check-anchors [-h] [--repo REPO] [--workflow WORKFLOW]\n                               [--ref REF] [--explorer EXPLORER]\n                               [--max-pending-hours H]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --repo REPO\n  --workflow WORKFLOW\n  --ref REF\n  --explorer EXPLORER   esplora API base; default blockstream.info and\n                        mempool.space\n  --max-pending-hours H\n                        exit 1 if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its\n                        sigstore attestation is older than H hours\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/record && python3 record.py check-anchors --help","time":{"start":1794917674145,"end":1794917674199}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"All 21 tests pass. The implementation is complete:\n\n1. Added `--max-pending-hours H` option to `check-anchors` command\n2. Without the option, behavior is unchanged (pending proofs accepted, exit 0)\n3. With the option, if any range head's proof is still pending and its Sigstore attestation time is more than H hours ago, exit 1 with message \"still pending N h\"\n4. A pending proof younger than H hours is fine (exit 0)\n5. All existing tests still pass\n\nLet me also verify the help output looks good.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e96e2c9e001RLfxD2yTMvxbPW","sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","messageID":"msg_1e96e24dd001LpEIZ3gG2iOPYu"}}
