{"type":"text","timestamp":1794917680753,"sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","part":{"id":"prt_1e96e3ab8001zMNwTfZM42Xy7B","messageID":"msg_1e96e2cdd001ksakDHW3ARk34J","sessionID":"ses_e16947aa2ffe1bQjYy6NyBOia0","type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n1. **Added `--max-pending-hours H` option** to the `check-anchors` subcommand\n2. **Modified `cmd_check_anchors`** to use a two-pass approach:\n   - First pass: process sigstore anchors and collect attestation times per range head\n   - Second pass: process OTS anchors, check if pending, and compare against attestation time if `--max-pending-hours` is set\n3. **Behavior**:\n   - Without the option: pending proofs accepted (exit 0) - unchanged\n   - With the option: if a range head's OTS proof is pending and its sigstore attestation is >H hours old, exits 1 with message `still pending N h` to stderr\n   - Confirmed OTS proofs always pass regardless of attestation age\n4. **All 21 existing tests pass**","time":{"start":1794917677752,"end":1794917680743}}}
